    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10231" root="خرأ" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْرَأَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A place where excrement,</i> or <i>ordure,</i> is
<i>voided;</i> [<i>a privy;</i>] (S, K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْرَاةٌ</span>, (K,)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْرُؤَةٌ</span></b> ; (T, S, K, TA;) the last written in
some copies of the K <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْرِئَةٌ</span>; and in one, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخْرَأَةٌ</span>.
(TA.)

